{"id":"especialmente","lemma":"especialmente","pos":"adv","rank":922,"glosses":["specially","especially"],"ipa":"/espeˌθjalˈmente/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b8/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-especialmente.wav","examples":[{"text":"Hoy no hace calor especialmente.","en":"It isn't especially hot today.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/706504"},{"text":"Me gusta escuchar música, especialmente jazz.","en":"I like listening to music, especially jazz.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/694133"},{"text":"Me gusta la música, especialmente el rock.","en":"I love music, especially rock.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/937541"},{"text":"Me gusta caminar, especialmente a la mañana.","en":"I like walking, especially in the morning.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/600010"},{"text":"Ella es especialmente atractiva.","en":"She is remarkably attractive."}]}